<h2>When to Go</h2>
<p>Hongdae is liveliest on Friday and Saturday nights when the streets are packed until dawn. If you prefer a calmer experience, weekday afternoons are surprisingly peaceful — you can browse shops and cafés without fighting through crowds. The neighborhood is also particularly atmospheric during autumn when the leaves change.</p>

